 194      6F676F22 
 194      3E3C2F61 
 195 01c3 35303022 		.ascii	"500\">\011  \015\012\011  <h1>lwIP - A Lightweight "
 195      3E092020 
 195      0D0A0920 
 195      203C6831 
 195      3E6C7749 
 196 01e9 5443502F 		.ascii	"TCP/IP Stack</h1>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    T"
 196      49502053 
 196      7461636B 
 196      3C2F6831 
 196      3E0D0A09 
 197 020a 68652077 		.ascii	"he web page you are watching was served by a simple"
 197      65622070 
 197      61676520 
 197      796F7520 
 197      61726520 
 198 023d 20776562 		.ascii	" web\015\012\011    server running on top of the li"
 198      0D0A0920 
 198      20202073 
 198      65727665 
 198      72207275 
 199 0267 67687477 		.ascii	"ghtweight TCP/IP stack <a\015\012\011    href=\"htt"
 199      65696768 
 199      74205443 
 199      502F4950 
 199      20737461 
 200 0290 703A2F2F 		.ascii	"p://www.sics.se/~adam/lwip/\">lwIP</a>.\015\012\011"
 200      7777772E 
 200      73696373 
 200      2E73652F 
 200      7E616461 
 201 02b9 20203C2F 		.ascii	"  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    lwIP is an o"
 201      703E0D0A 
 201      0920203C 
 201      703E0D0A 
 201      09202020 
 202 02da 70656E20 		.ascii	"pen source implementation of the TCP/IP\015\012\011"
 202      736F7572 
 202      63652069 
 202      6D706C65 
 202      6D656E74 
 203 0304 20202020 		.ascii	"    protocol suite that was originally written by <"
 203      70726F74 
 203      6F636F6C 
 203      20737569 
 203      74652074 
 204 0337 610D0A09 		.ascii	"a\015\012\011    href=\"http://www.sics.se/~adam/lw"
 204      20202020 
 204      68726566 
 204      3D226874 
 204      74703A2F 
 205 0360 69702F22 		.ascii	"ip/\">Adam Dunkels\015\012\011    of the Swedish In"
 205      3E416461 
 205      6D204475 
 205      6E6B656C 
 205      730D0A09 
 206 0389 73746974 		.ascii	"stitute of Computer Science</a> but now is\015\012\011"
 206      75746520 
 206      6F662043 
 206      6F6D7075 
 206      74657220 
 207 03b6 20202020 		.ascii	"    being actively developed by a team of developer"
 207      6265696E 
 207      67206163 
 207      74697665 
 207      6C792064 
 208 03e9 730D0A09 		.ascii	"s\015\012\011    distributed world-wide. Since it's"
 208      20202020 
 208      64697374 
 208      72696275 
 208      74656420 
 209 0413 2072656C 		.ascii	" release, lwIP has\015\012\011    spurred a lot of "
 209      65617365 
 209      2C206C77 
 209      49502068 
 209      61730D0A 
 210 043d 696E7465 		.ascii	"interest and has been ported to several\015\012\011"
 210      72657374 
 210      20616E64 
 210      20686173 
 210      20626565 
 211 0467 20202020 		.ascii	"    platforms and operating systems. lwIP can be us"
 211      706C6174 
 211      666F726D 
 211      7320616E 
 211      64206F70 
 212 049a 65642065 		.ascii	"ed either\015\012\011    with or without an underly"
 212      69746865 
 212      720D0A09 
 212      20202020 
 212      77697468 
 213 04c4 696E6720 		.ascii	"ing OS.\015\012\011  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011"
 213      4F532E0D 
 213      0A092020 
 213      3C2F703E 
 213      0D0A0920 
 214 04df 20202020 		.ascii	"    The focus of the lwIP TCP/IP implementation is "
 214      54686520 
 214      666F6375 
 214      73206F66 
 214      20746865 
 215 0512 746F2072 		.ascii	"to reduce\015\012\011    the RAM usage while still "
 215      65647563 
 215      650D0A09 
 215      20202020 
 215      74686520 
 216 053c 68617669 		.ascii	"having a full scale TCP. This\015\012\011    makes "
 216      6E672061 
 216      2066756C 
 216      6C207363 
 216      616C6520 
 217 0566 6C774950 		.ascii	"lwIP suitable for use in embedded systems with tens"
 217      20737569 
 217      7461626C 
 217      6520666F 
 217      72207573 
 218 0599 0D0A0920 		.ascii	"\015\012\011    of kilobytes of free RAM and room f"
 218      2020206F 
 218      66206B69 
 218      6C6F6279 
 218      74657320 
 219 05c3 6F722061 		.ascii	"or around 40 kilobytes\015\012\011    of code ROM.\015"
 219      726F756E 
 219      64203430 
 219      206B696C 
 219      6F627974 
 220 05ed 0A092020 		.ascii	"\012\011  </p>\015\012\011  <p>\015\012\011    More"
